    "chunk_text": "standan & \u00feonne hine mon drincan wille onhrere eft, wyrce \u00feonne Gif he sie to unswi\u00f0 gegnide he fiftig lyb corna, geswete \u00feonne. Wyrce swi\u00f0ran gif he wille, adelfe \u00fea greatan wyrt, ascrep \u00fea greatan rinde of, gecnuwa \u00feonne Se drenc bi\u00fe swa selra swa \u00fe\u00e6t ealu selre bi\u00fe. Spiwedrenc, genim ellenrinde ni\u00feewearde & hamwyrte & hundteontig lybcorna, gecnua swi\u00fee Gif se drenc nelle of, genim onred, selle on eala\u00f0 drincan scenc fulne wearmes, sona bi\u00fe sel. Wyrc spiwdrenc, genim lybcorn & pipor corn & hwit cwuda & alwan, grind to duste \u00fea wyrta Gif \u00feu on wine wyrce o\u00fe\u00fee on meolce geswet mid hunige, drince tela micelne scenc fulne. Spiwedrenc wyrc of beore, do cost to & alwan & lybcorna fiftyne, \u00feara o\u00feera gelice. Spiwedrenc, hamwyrte III sn\u00e6da & ellen rinde berende gelice micel, XXV lybcorna, gegnid, do Gif drenc of men nelle genim merce & cerfillan, seo\u00fe swi\u00fee on w\u00e6tre, do sealt to, drince \u00feonne. Gif hine innan w\u00e6rce genim niges eala\u00f0 amber fulne, do hand fulle hamwyrte on, l\u00e6t on hebban Nim scamoniam \u00fe\u00e6t penig gewege & gegnid sm\u00e6le & hrer henne \u00e6g, swi\u00f0e sealt, do \u00fea wyrt on, Wyrtdrenc, scamonian geceos \u00feus, brec on tu, do hwon on \u00feine tungan, gif",
